<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Organic_Chemistry/Organic_Chemistry_(Morsch_et_al.)/07:_Alkenes-_Structure_and_Reactivity/7.12:_Evidence_for_the_Mechanism_of_Electrophilic_Additions_-_Carbocation_Rearrangements" class="mt-section"><span id="Exercise_.5C(.5CPageIndex.7B1.7D.5C)"></span><h5 class="box-legend lt-chem-31461" id="Exercise_.5C(.5CPageIndex.7B1.7D.5C)-31461"><span class="lt-icon-default">Exercise \(\PageIndex{1}\)</span></h5>

