<p class="lt-chem-31461">The following reaction shows a rearrangement within the mechanism. Propose a mechanism that shows this.</p>

<p class="mt-align-center lt-chem-31461"><img alt="clipboard_e3a725eac0ce87e452b41ea257812730e.png" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/376187/clipboard_e3a725eac0ce87e452b41ea257812730e.png?revision=1" /></p>

